CONNECT localhost:TLS
CONNECT localhost:TLS
CONNECT localhost:TLS12
CONNECT 127.0.0.1:TLS
CONNECT localhost:PORT
-- no_proxy=localhost: localhost reached directly, the address through the proxy
CONNECT 127.0.0.1:TLS
